msgid "d-pad or stick"
msgstr "cruceta o stick"

#: package/contents/ui/WrapImportDialog.qml:62
msgid "Import full box"
msgstr "Importar caja completa"

#: package/contents/ui/WrapImportDialog.qml:68
msgid "Create spine and cover"
msgstr "Crear lomo y portada"

#: package/contents/ui/WrapImportDialog.qml:110
msgid "Could not save the images to %1."
msgstr "No se pudieron guardar las imágenes en %1."

#: package/contents/ui/WrapImportDialog.qml:126
msgid ""
"Drag the lines to mark both edges of the spine, the right edge of the front "
"cover and the top and bottom edges. The back cover is not used."
msgstr ""
"Arrastra las líneas para marcar los dos bordes del lomo, el borde derecho de "
"la portada y los bordes de arriba y abajo. La contraportada no se usa."

#: package/contents/ui/WrapImportDialog.qml:308
msgid ""
"With the spine set to “Real proportions”, the spine is shown as is, without "
"stretching."
msgstr ""
"Con el lomo en «Proporción real», el lomo se ve tal cual, sin deformarse."

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:63
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Estilo"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:67
msgid "Look:"
msgstr "Cómo se ven:"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:68
msgid "Shelf"
msgstr "Estantería"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:69
msgid "Spines on shelves; hover over one and the box slides out and turns."
msgstr "Lomos en repisas; al pasar el cursor la caja sale y gira."

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:74
msgid "Jukebox"
msgstr "Rocola"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:75
msgid ""
"Covers facing you; the selected one grows. If they don't fit, it becomes a "
"carousel."
msgstr "Portadas de frente; la elegida crece. Si no caben, es un carrusel."

