msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Medianas"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:88
msgid "Small"
msgstr "Pequeñas"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:94
#: package/contents/ui/configGames.qml:1036
msgid "Spine:"
msgstr "Lomo:"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:95
msgid "Real proportions"
msgstr "Proporción real"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:96
msgid "Each spine as wide as its image really is. Ideal for full box art."
msgstr ""
"Cada lomo con el ancho real de su imagen. Ideal para arte de caja completa."

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:101
msgid "Thick"
msgstr "Grueso"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:102
msgid "Wide spines with the game's name or logo."
msgstr "Lomos anchos con el nombre o el logo del juego."

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:109
msgid "Scroll bar"
msgstr "Barra para recorrer"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:113
msgid "Bar:"
msgstr "Barra:"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:114
msgid "Show the bar below the shelf"
msgstr "Mostrar la barra bajo la estantería"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:123
msgid "One dot per game: slide the dot to browse them and release to play."
msgstr "Un punto por juego: desliza el punto para verlos y suelta para jugar."

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:128
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "Compatibilidad"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:136
msgid ""
"Your Qt version is older than 6.9: the widget is already using compatibility "
"mode even if the box is unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Tu versión de Qt es anterior a la 6.9: el widget ya usa el modo "
"compatibilidad aunque no marques la casilla."

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:140
msgid "Compatibility mode:"
msgstr "Modo compatibilidad:"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:141
msgid "For Qt versions older than 6.9"
msgstr "Para versiones de Qt anteriores a la 6.9"

#: package/contents/ui/configAppearance.qml:151
msgid ""
"What you lose: the soft shadows of the boxes (simpler layered shadows are "
"used instead) and the crisp clipping of the disc art (a mask is used and the "
"edge may look slightly less smooth). Everything else works the same."
msgstr ""
"Lo que se pierde: las sombras suaves de las cajas (se usan sombras por "
"capas, más simples) y el recorte nítido de la portada del disco (se usa una "
"máscara y el borde puede verse un poco menos fino). Todo lo demás funciona "
"igual."

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:72
msgid ""
"No button was received. Check that the gamepad is connected and try again."
msgstr ""
"No se recibió ningún botón. Comprueba que el mando esté conectado y vuelve a "
"intentarlo."

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:77
msgid "That combination can't be used (4 buttons at once at most)."
msgstr "Esa combinación no se puede usar (como mucho 4 botones a la vez)."

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:81
msgid ""
"You chose a single button. Keep in mind you'll also press it while playing: "
"a combination is safer."
msgstr ""
"Has elegido un solo botón. Ten en cuenta que también lo pulsarás jugando: "
"una combinación es más segura."

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:86
msgid "Choose a single button."
msgstr "Elige un solo botón."

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:101
msgid "Menu (Options)"
msgstr "Menú (Options)"

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:101
msgid "View (Share)"
msgstr "Vista (Share)"

