msgid "Hold it for:"
msgstr "Mantenerla durante:"

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:235
msgid "Play:"
msgstr "Jugar:"

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:238
#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:252
msgid "Press a button…"
msgstr "Pulsa un botón…"

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:249
msgid "Leave:"
msgstr "Salir:"

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:263
msgid "Move:"
msgstr "Moverse:"

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:264
msgid "D-pad or left stick"
msgstr "Cruceta o stick izquierdo"

#: package/contents/ui/configGamepad.qml:282
msgid ""
"The gamepad keeps listening while you play, so choose a combination you "
"don't use in games. If you ever press it by accident, increase the hold "
"time. With Steam open, Steam Input may create a second virtual gamepad: if a "
"button counts twice, disable Steam Input for the desktop."
msgstr ""
"El mando sigue escuchando mientras juegas, así que elige una combinación que "
"no uses en los juegos. Si alguna vez la pulsas sin querer, sube el tiempo de "
"mantenerla. Con Steam abierto, Steam Input puede crear un segundo mando "
"virtual: si algún botón cuenta dos veces, desactiva Steam Input para el "
"escritorio."

