#: package/contents/ui/configPlay.qml:58
msgid ""
"A click, Esc or the gamepad's leave button cancels it. While it spins, the "
"game is not launched again."
msgstr ""
"Un clic, Esc o el botón de salir del mando la cancelan. Mientras gira, el "
"juego no se vuelve a lanzar."

