msgid "Keep Steam minimized while the disc spins"
msgstr "Mantener Steam minimizado mientras gira el disco"

#: package/contents/ui/configPlay.qml:78
msgid ""
"If Steam opens a window (for example, to update the game), it is minimized "
"so the whole animation can be seen. The game's window is not touched."
msgstr ""
"Si Steam abre una ventana (por ejemplo, para actualizar el juego), se "
"minimiza para que la animación se vea entera. La ventana del juego no se "
"toca."

